  m_text: 'When a normal note reaches the target circle, press the corresponding
    direction key (W, A, S, D) at the right time.


    Hit it as close to the beat
    as possible to gain a higher score and maintain your combo.


    Missing or
    pressing too early/late will break your combo and slightly reduce your health
    bar.'
